From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rosons <rosons@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 May 2026 12:08:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Responses -> ChatCompletions protocol downgrade
 compatibility

When /v1/responses requests hit channels that don't support the Responses
API (e.g. DeepSeek, Zhipu GLM), convert to Chat Completions format
automatically. Key points:
- developer role auto-mapped to system
- non-function tools filtered out
- tool parameter schema patched
- DeepSeek thinking mode adapted
- Streaming and non-streaming response conversion

Based on PR QuantumNous/new-api#5209
(https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/pull/5209)

Adapted for upstream refactoring (openaicompat -> relayconvert).
i18n changes handled by separate script for cross-version compatibility.
